OL,3,ASinger Lola Young says vaping has made
OL,4,Abreathing feel like a 'chore'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Lola Young has said her
OL,7,Fbreathing feels like a "chore" due to
OL,8,Fthe effects of vaping.
OL,10,FIn a TikTok video, the Grammy winner
OL,11,Ftold her followers her lungs feel
OL,12,F"battery powered".
OL,14,FThe 25-year-old has previously
OL,15,Facknowledged in videos she "should
OL,16,Fquit", but suggested in her latest post
OL,17,Fthat is unlikely to happen any time
OL,18,Fsoon.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
