OL,3,ASinger Lola Young says vaping has made
OL,4,Abreathing feel like a 'chore'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVocal coach Lizzii Hills has told BBC
OL,7,FNewsbeat vaping is "not advised" for
OL,8,Fartists and that difficulty breathing
OL,9,Fcan affect a singer's voice and
OL,10,Fperformance.
